WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.513
The chapter's tests are seven, in the
writers-and-contractors test file.

2
00:00:04.513 --> 00:00:08.260
They check that the earliest
end takes the first condition,

3
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.784
that an expired card ends an engagement,

4
00:00:10.784 --> 00:00:14.149
that a record with no end or
no sponsor is quarantined,

5
00:00:14.149 --> 00:00:16.596
that a duplicate person key is refused,

6
00:00:16.596 --> 00:00:21.567
that the extract matches the middleware's
layout and marks past ends inactive,

7
00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:24.320
that the reconciliation finds every class,

8
00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.838
and that the review removes
access when no one responds.

9
00:00:27.838 --> 00:00:32.900
All fifty-seven tests in the kit pass
with no package, tenant or network.
